      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.16 (up from ₹0.58 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹919.5m (up 224% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹153.4m (up ₹139.0m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 17% (up from 5.1% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 285% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
